   ('The other Five', 'Her unit', 'Monkey, Viper, Crane and Mantis fall as Kai\'s collection; their beats — the failed lesson, the Valley defence, the Palace stand — are carried in this page and Po\'s, and their restoration is the climax\'s dividend.'),
